OL,3,ADoctor in court to face Rwanda genocide
OL,4,Acharges
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 65-year-old doctor has appeared in
OL,7,Fcourt, the first person in the UK to be
OL,8,Fcharged over the genocide in Rwanda in
OL,9,F1994.
OL,11,FDr Vincent Brown, formerly Dr Vincent
OL,12,FBajinya, who is in custody, confirmed
OL,13,Fhis name and address from the dock at
OL,14,FWestminster Magistrates' Court.
OL,16,FHe was charged following a seven year
OL,17,FBritish investigation into the
OL,18,Fkillings.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,318,300,200,140,0,100
